<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Son Eternal, we adore Thee!</l><l>Lamb upon the throne on high!</l><l>Lamb of God, we bow before Thee,</l><l>Thou hast brought Thy people nigh!</l><l>We adore Thee! we adore Thee!</l><l>Son of God, Who came to die!</l><l>We adore Thee! we adore Thee!</l><l>Son of God, Who came to die!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Father, Son and Holy Spirit—</l><l>Three in One! we give Thee praise!</l><l>For the riches we inherit,</l><l>Heart and voice to Thee we raise!</l><l>We adore Thee! we adore Thee!</l><l>Thee we bless, through endless days!</l><l>We adore Thee! we adore Thee!</l><l>Thee we bless, through endless days!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
